<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">Yaƹqub</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yaƹ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yaƹqub</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Yaƹqub</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Yaƹqub</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="s1">Arrasul Yaƹqub itseǧam x ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Nec ḏ Yaƹqub ḏ ȓƹabḏ n Arebbi ḏ ȓƹabḏ n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, tseǧameɣ x ṯenƹac n ṯqebbaȓ <char style="it">n ȓmuminin</char> iy itemzeǧaƹen x ṯmura.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lʼiman ḏ ȓemḥayen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Ay ayṯma, farḥem aṭṭas xmi ɣa ṯiȓim ḏi lʼanwaƹ n ȓemḥayen. <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />Kenniw ṯessnem marra ȓemḥayen-a iy ṯseƹḏum ƹlaḥsab lʼiman nwem tawint-id ṣṣbar. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />U labud ṣṣbar-a aḏaywem ikemmeȓ ccɣeȓ nnes ḥima aḏ temɣarem aḏ tƹemmarem s lʼiman war ḏawem ṯneqqiṣ uȓa ḏ ijjen n ȓhajeṯ. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Meȓa can yijjen zzaywem itxeṣṣa-yas ȓefhameṯ, aḏas t ittar i Arebbi netta aḏas t yuc. Minzi netta ifassen nnes rezzmen war itḥeggar ḥadd. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Walakin manaya itxeṣṣa-yas aḏas ṯ ittar s lʼiman bȓa ma aḏ icekk ȓaḥeqqac wenni itcekkan igga am ȓmujeṯ n ȓebḥar ishaja-t arriḥ itawi-t itarra-t-id. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Bnaḏem-a itxeṣṣa-yas war itfekkir ca belli Siḏi Arebbi aḏas yuc can ȓḥajeṯ. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Itcekka, kuȓ ȓaƹqeȓ nnes min ḏas iqqar menbaƹd itḏewwax ḏeg ibriḏen nnes marra.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Fa itxeṣṣa-yas i ȓmeskin ig yumnen aḏ iftaxar minzi isgaƹƹeḏ-iṯ Arebbi. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Itxeṣṣa-yas i ttajar ig yumnen aḏ iftaxar minzi netta isehwa-ṯ Arebbi, ȓaḥeqqac ttajar igga am nwar n arbiƹ war itdummin ca. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Tsummar-d ṯfuct, s ȓeḥmu nnes issecmaḍen tsazzaɣ arbiƹ, iweṭṭa nwar nnes itraḥ zzin nnes. Ammu iy ḏas itewqiƹ i ttajar-a, netta itisraw axmi ixeddem ccɣeȓ nnes.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Ssaƹḏ n wenni iṣbaren x ȓemḥayen ataf xmi ɣa injeḥ aḏ iysi ttaj n ṯudarṯ wenni iy zi iƹaheḏ Arebbi yinni iy ṯ itḥibban. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Meȓa itwaɣarra can yijjen, itxeṣṣa-yas war iqqar ca qa ḏ Arebbi iy ḏayi itɣarran. Lla, Arebbi war itɣarri ḥadd, war itwaɣarri ca s ccarr. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Netta bnaḏem itwaɣarra s ssabab n ccehweṯ nnes ṯaƹeffant, nettaṯ iy ṯ itjarran nettaṯ iy ṯ ixeddƹen. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Ṯumma ccehweṯ-a wami ṯeysi aƹeddis ṯurew-d ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, ṯumma ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ-a wami ṯemɣar ṯejja-d ȓmewṯ.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Ay ayṯma imƹizzen inu, war xeddƹeṯ ca ixef nwem. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Marra ṯimuca ṯiṣebḥanin ḏ lhadiyaṯ ikemȓen tekkent-id zeg ujenna, tasent-id zi Arebbi Babas n nnur. Netta war itbeddiȓ ca am ṯiȓi nni ig igguren. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Wami ixes netta, ikkar yarra-aneɣ ḏ ṯarwa nnes iy d ijja s wawaȓ n lḥaqiqa ḥima a niȓi neccin ḏ imezwura zi min d ixȓeq.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wenni itṣennaṭen ɣar wawaȓ n Arebbi itxeṣṣa-as aṯ igg</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Cuf ay ayṯma inu imƹizzen, itxeṣṣa kuȓ ijjen aḏ itsȓa aṭṭas, aḏ ifekkar qbeȓ ma aḏ issiweȓ, war itƹaṣṣib ca ḏeɣya. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Minzi aƹeṣṣeb n bnaḏem war d isiwwiḍ ca min iǧan ḏ ȓḥaqq ɣar Arebbi. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Beƹƹḏeṯ x marra min iǧan ḏ aƹeffan ḏ min iǧan ḏ ccarr. Bȓa ttakebbur qebbȓeṯ awaȓ nni <char style="it">n Arebbi</char> itwaẓẓun ḏaywem izemmar aḏ isenjem ȓaƹmar nwem.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Fa maci aḏ tesȓem i wawaȓ n Arebbi u ṣafi; Itxeṣṣa-kenniw azzayes ṯxeddmem ḥima war ṯxeddƹem ca ixef nwem. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23-24" />Maṯalan, ijjen ixezzar ḏeg uɣembub nnes mliḥ ḏi ṯisiṯ waha. Wami ixzar mliḥ, iruḥ ittu ḏeɣya ixef nnes mammec iǧa. Ammu ig iǧa wenni itsȓan i wawaȓ n Arebbi war zzayes ixeddem ca. <verse eid="JAS 1:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Walakin wenni ixezzaren ḏi ccariƹa ikemȓen ṯenni iy ḏi ṯeǧa lḥurriya, iteṭṭef ḏayes war itettu ca min itsȓa ixeddem zzayes, ataf azzayes yawi lbaraka ḏi min itegg. <verse eid="JAS 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Wenni itḥassaben ixef nnes ɣares ddin war iḥeṭṭi ca iȓes nnes, ataf ixeddeƹ ixef nnes waha war ɣares bu ddin. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Ddin iṣfan iy inqan ɣar Arebbi Babaṯneɣ min iƹna? Iƹni bnaḏem itraḥ ɣar yujiȓen ḏ ṯajjaȓin aṯen iƹawen ḏeg uzeyyar nsen, aḏ iḥḍa ixef nnes ḥima war ṯ twessix ca ddunect-a.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Uḏemawen tsebbaben i ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Ay ayṯma, kenniw ṯumnem zi Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ iy ɣar ṯeǧa lƹaḍama, war teggeṯ ca s wuḏemawen jar yiwḏan. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Maṯalan, yuḏef-d ijjen n ttajar ɣar jmaƹeṯ nwem igga ṯxaḏent n ddheb ḏeg ufus nnes yareḍ arruḍ iṣbaḥ. Iḏfar-iṯ-id ijjen ḏ ȓmeskin arruḍ nnes iwessex. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Kenniw ḏeɣya ṯeqqarem-as i wenni iggin arruḍ ḏ aṣebḥan: Qqim cek ḏanita ḏeg umcan-a aṣebḥan. Ṯeqqarem-as ƹaweḏ i ȓmeskin: Cek bedd ḏiha niɣ qqim ḏanita ḏi ṯmurṯ ɣar iḍaren nneɣ. <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Iƹni teggem s wuḏemawen ak wayawya tmeyyazem jar yiwḏan s lʼafkar ṯiƹeffanin.<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Cuf ay ayṯma imƹizzen inu, ma war ṯessinem ca Arebbi ixḍar ȓmusakin n ddunect-a ḥima aḏ iȓin ḏ twajar s lʼiman nsen aḏ warṯen ḏi ȓmulk iy zi iwƹeḏ Arebbi yinni iy ṯ itḥibban? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Walakin kenniw ṯḥeggarem ȓmusakin! Ma war ṯessinem ca ḏ twajar iy kenniw iy ḍeǧmen, tjarran-kenniw ɣar lmaḥakim? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Ma war ṯessinem ca belli ḏ niṯni ig issawaȓen s ȓƹib ḏeg yisem aṣebḥan n Lmasiḥ wenni iy zi ḏawem tȓaɣan yiwḏan?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Ȓuṣiyeṯ n Uzeǧiḏ izeǧiḏen iy d yusin ḏi Lkitab ṯeqqar: "Aḏ texseḏ ajjar nnec amecnaw ixef nnec." Kenniw aḏ teggem mliḥ meȓa ṯxeddmem zzayes. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Walakin meȓa teggem s wuḏemawen jar yiwḏan, aqa kenniw teggem ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, ṯḥekkem xawem ccariƹa belli ṯeƹṣam. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Liʼanna wenni ixeddmen ḏi Ccariƹa-ya marra, meȓa ixḍa ɣir ḏeg yijjen n ȓuṣiyeṯ nnes ataf netta ixḍa ḏi ccariƹa amen-ṯekmaȓ. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Liʼanna wenni innan: &lt;War zenna ca&gt; inna ƹaweḏ &lt;War neqq ca.&gt; Meȓa ṯenɣiḏ war ṯezniḏ ca, ataf ṯeƹṣiḏ s ccariƹa.<verse eid="JAS 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Iwa ssiwȓeṯ ggeṯ am yiwḏan iy xef ɣa iḥkem Arebbi s ccariƹa nni iy ḏi ṯeǧa lḥurriya. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Nhar n Lḥisab Arebbi war ireḥḥem ca wenni war ireḥḥmen ca; arraḥmeṯ ṯɣeǧeb lḥisab.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Min iƹna lʼiman bȓa lḥasanaṯ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Ay ayṯma, min ṯ ɣa inefƹen bnaḏem meȓa iqqar nec ḏ ȓmumen walakin ȓexḏayem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ḏi lʼayaṯ-a nessawaȓ x yijjen n bnaḏem iqqar nec ḏ ȓmumen ḏayi lʼiman, walakin ḏi ȓexḏayem nnes war ɣares ca lḥasanaṯ. Iƹni netta ḏ lmunafiq waha.</char></note> nnes war d tesbeyyinent ca belli netta ḏ ȓmumen? Ma ḏ lʼiman-a iy ṯ ɣa isnejmen? Lla ƹemmarṣ! <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Aqa icten n wučmaṯneɣ niɣ ḏ yijjen n wumaṯneɣ war ɣares bu arruḍ iy ɣa yareḍ ḏayes jjuƹ. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Ṯenniḏ-as cek niɣ ḏ ḥadd nneɣni: "Ruḥ aḏ tecceḏ aḏ tarḍeḏ arruḍ. Ac iƹawen Arebbi axak isehheȓ." Iƹni cek war ḏas tuciḏ ca min ṯeḥḏaj ddat nnes. Man nnfaƹ ḏi manaya? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Lʼiman nnec amenni meȓa war d isbeyyen ca ȓexḏayem nnes itwaḥsab immuṯ.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Imken can yijjen aḏ yini: "Iwa cek ḏayec lʼiman nnec, nec ɣari ȓexḏayem inu." <char style="it">Nec qqareɣ:</char> "Cek sbeyyen-ayi-d mammec igga lʼiman nnec bȓa ȓexḏayem nnec, nec aḏac sbeyyneɣ mammec igga lʼiman inu s ȓexḏayem inu." <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Cek tamneḏ belli Arebbi netta ḏ ijjen? Iwa mliḥ, walakin uȓa ḏ ccayaṭin tamnen s manayenni terjijin.<verse eid="JAS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Ay aryaz, cek ṯqefȓeḏ! Ma nec aḏawem d sbeyyneɣ belli lʼiman bȓa ȓexḏayem war ḏayes bu nnfaƹ? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Xzar ɣar jeddiṯneɣ Brahim, aqa iḥseb-iṯ Arebbi nican s min igga Brahim wami iqeddem mmis Isḥaq x ȓmeḏbaḥ. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Aqa twaȓiḏ lʼiman n Brahim ixeddem ak ȓexḏayem nnes, uca lʼiman nnes iḏweȓ ikmaȓ s ȓexḏayem-a iy igga. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Ḏ wa ḏ ȓmaƹna n wawaȓ nni n Arebbi ḏi Lkitab wami inna: "Uca yumen Brahim zi Arebbi, ikkar Arebbi isemṣȓaḥ-iṯ akiḏes s lʼiman nni." Amenni ig ijja Arebbi Brahim ḏ ameddukeȓ nnes. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Kenniw isbeyyen-awem-d Arebbi iḥesseb bnaḏem nican maci ɣir s lʼiman nnes u ṣafi, uȓa s ȓexḏayem nnes.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Amenni uȓa ḏ ṯaḥenjirṯ nni umi qqaren Riḥab tuɣa ṯeffeɣ abriḏ, iḥseb-it Arebbi nican s min ṯegga wami ṯreḥḥeb zi ṯnayen nni n lmuxabarat, <char style="it">ṯsenjem-iṯen</char> ṯessekk-iṯen x yijjen n ubriḏ nneɣni. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Cuf, ddat n bnaḏem bȓa buḥbeȓ ṯemmuṯ, amenni lʼiman bȓa ȓexḏayem immuṯ.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ccarr iy iǧan ḏeg yiȓes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Ay ayṯma, itxeṣṣa war zzaywem itiȓi bu aṭṭas n imseȓmaḏen, aqa ṯessnem belli neccin imseȓmaḏen ataf axaneɣ izeyyar Arebbi ḏi lḥisab. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Marra iḏneɣ ntegg aṭṭas n lɣalaṭ. Meȓa can yijjen war ixeṭṭi ca ḏeg wawaȓ nnes qaƹ, ataf wanita ḏ ijjen n bnaḏem nican ikmaȓ. Izemmar aḏ iḥkem x ddat nnes marra.<verse eid="JAS 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Xmi ntegg sȓimeṯ deg uqemmum n ikiddaren, nneddeh-iṯen mani ma nexs. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Cuf ƹaweḏ, aɣarrabu waxxa ḏ ameqqran aṭṭas iḏeffeƹ-iṯ arriḥ ijehḏen, walakin arrayes izemmar aṯ indeh s yijjen n dmam ḏ amezyan aṯ indeh mani ma ixes.<verse eid="JAS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Uȓa ḏ iȓes nneɣ netta ḏ ijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ ḏ ṯamezyant ḏi ddat nneɣ, walakin iteftaxar s ṯmesȓayin ṯimeqqranin. Cuf, ijjen n ȓɣabeṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant ṯesḥarreq-it ijjen n ṯȓuqit ḏ ṯamezyant! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Iȓes netta ḏ ijjen n ṯmessi ḏayes ccarr aṭṭas iswessax marra min ɣarneɣ ḏi ddat nneɣ. Isruɣa ṯimessi ḏi marra ṯuḏarṯ nneɣ, ƹaweḏ netta s yixef nnes ṯesruqq-iṯ ṯmessi n jahennama.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Izemmar bnaḏem aḏ irebba ȓuḥuc ḏ ijḍaḍ ḏ min itenḥuruḏen ḏ min itƹicen ḏi ȓebḥar mkuȓ nnuƹ, u ḏ ṣṣaḥ netta itrebba-ṯen. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Walakin bnaḏem war izemmar aḏ irebba iȓes nnes, mayemmi? Netta ḏ ijjen n ccarr war iǧi uw iy ṯ ɣa isbedden iƹemmar s ssem ineqqen.<verse eid="JAS 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Zzayes iy nḥemmeḏ Siḏi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ. Ma zzayes ƹaweḏ iy zi ɣa nenƹeȓ iryazen iy d ixȓeq Arebbi x ṣṣifeṯ nnes? <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Wac zeg yijjen n uqemmum iy zi ɣa nsufeɣ ccuker ḏ nnaƹȓeṯ? Lla ay ayṯma, manaya itxeṣṣa war itiȓi ca. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Ma zemmaren aḏ ffɣen waman ḏ imiziḍen ḏ imerzagen zeg yijjen n ȓƹunṣar? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Lla ay ayṯma. Ma ṯzemmar ṯcejjarṯ n ṯazarṯ aḏ tarew zzitun, niɣ ṯzayarṯ uḍiȓ aḏ tarew ṯazarṯ? Lla. Uȓa ḏ ȓƹunṣar ameǧaḥ war izemmar aḏ d isufeɣ aman ḏ imiziḍen.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ṯanita ḏ ȓefhameṯ n ṣṣaḥ iy d yusin zi Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Ma akiḏwem wenni iy ḏi ṯeǧa ȓefhameṯ ḏ ṯusna?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯusna nettaṯ ḏ lmaƹrifa.</char></note> Itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ d ismeḍhar manaya s mammec itƹic s lmaƹqul ḏ lḥasanaṯ nnes ig itegg ak yijjen n ttawaḍuƹ iy d itasen s ȓefhameṯ. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Walakin meȓa ḏaywem ȓeḥseḏ ḏ aƹeffan ḏ lʼananiya, war teftaxareṯ ca s yixef nwem. Iƹni itxeṣṣa-yawem kenniw war ṯesxarriqem ca x lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Nnuƹ n ȓefhameṯ-a war d thewwi ca zeg ujenna; Lla, nettaṯ n ddunect-a n yiwḏan n Cciṭan. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Minzi mani ma iǧa ȓeḥseḏ ḏ lʼananiya, ḏinni uȓa ḏ ȓfawḍa ḏ kuȓ ccarr.<verse eid="JAS 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Ȓefhameṯ iy d ihewwan zeg ujenna, min ḏayes muhim qaƹ aḏ tiȓi ṯeṣfa. Nettaṯ ƹaweḏ ḏayes ȓehna ḏ ṣṣbar, war ḏayes tiȓi bu ṯɣennant. Ṯeccur s arraḥmeṯ ḏ lḥasanaṯ, war ḏayes bu wuḏemawen niɣ ḏ nnifaq. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Yinni isemṣȓaḥen iwḏan zerrƹen manayenni, ataf aḏ mjaren ijjen n ṯfeǧaḥṯ n ȓḥaqq.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ibriḏen n ddunect-a tƹarraḍen i Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Iwa ixarwiḍen ḏ imenɣiwen itiȓin jarawem, manis d tekken? Tekken-d zi ccehawaṯ nwem ṯiƹeffanin iy itmenɣan ɣar ḏaxeȓ nwem. <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Xmi war tifem ca kenniw x minxef ṯrezzum, ataf ṯneqqem. Tmenɣam temnaqarem jarawem, mayemmi? Liʼanna kenniw war ṯzemmarem ca aḏ tawḍem ɣar min ṯƹeccqem. War ɣarwem ca, mayemmi? Liʼanna kenniw war tettarem ca i Arebbi. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Xmi ḏas tettarem war ḏawem d iticc ca, mayemmi? Liʼanna kenniw tɣalaṭem ḏi min ḏas tettarem, ṯexsem aḏ tseƹƹfem ccehawaṯ nwem u ṣafi.<verse eid="JAS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />A yinni ixeddƹen, kenniw ma war ṯessinem ca belli wenni itexsen ddunect-a ḏ wenni ḏ ȓaƹḏu n Arebbi? Wah, wenni ixḍaren dunnect-a qa netta nican ḏ ȓƹaḏu n Arebbi. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Awaȓ n Lkitab iqqar: &lt;Arruḥ nni iy ḏayneɣ igga Arebbi iƹizz xas aṭṭas.&gt; Ma tɣiȓ-awem awaȓ nni war ɣares bu ȓmaƹna? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Walakin netta yarni-yaneɣ-d arḍa <char style="it">zzayes</char>. S manaya iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Arebbi aqaṯ ḍed n yinni isemɣaren ixef nsen, yinni isemzayen ixef nsen iticc-asen arḍa <char style="it">nnes</char>.&gt;<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />S manaya ṭaƹeṯ i Arebbi. Ƹarrḍeṯ i Ibȓis, azzaywem yarweȓ. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Aḏseṯ ɣar Arebbi, netta aɣarwem d yaḏes. A yinni ixḍan, sirḏeṯ ifassen nwem. A yinni kuȓ ȓaƹqeȓ min ḏawem iqqar, seṣfaṯ uȓawen nwem. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Xeyyqem, ḥeznem, trum. Beddȓem ṯaḍeḥḥact nwem ɣar imeṭṭawen ḏ ȓefraḥeṯ nwem ɣar uxiyyeq. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Semzyeṯ ixef nwem zzaṯ i Siḏi Arebbi, netta akenniw isemɣar.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">War tƹeyyab ca umac</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Ay ayṯma, war qqareṯ bu ȓbaṭeȓ x wayawya. Minzi wenni iqqaren ȓbaṭeȓ x wumas niɣ itƹeyyab-iṯ, ataf iqqar ȓbaṭeȓ x ccariƹa itƹeyyab-it. Xmi tƹeyyabeḏ ccariƹa ataf cek war zzayes ṯxeddmeḏ ca; Lla, ataf cek ḏ ȓqaḍi nnes waha. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Ḏinni ijjen ig iggin ccariƹa netta ƹaweḏ ḏ ȓqaḍi, <char style="it">netta ḏ Arebbi</char>. Netta waḥḏes ig izemmaren aḏ isenjem izemmar aḏ isefna, walakin min ṯeƹniḏ cek tƹeyyabeḏ ajjar nnec?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ḏeg ufus n Arebbi iy ḏi ṯeǧa ṯuḏarṯ nneɣ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Ṣennṭeṯ mliḥ a yinni iqqaren, "Yallaheṯ a nraḥ nhara niɣ ṯiwecca ɣar ṯendint-in niɣ ɣar ṯendint-a, a nseƹḏu ḏinni lƹam a negg ttijara bac a nerbeḥ." <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Iwa, ma ṯessnem min ɣa iweqƹen ṯiwecca? Lla, aqa ṯudarṯ nwem tegg am yijjen n ṯseynut, tmeḍhar-d ḏeɣya, ḏeɣya traḥ. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Itxeṣṣa-yawem aḏ tinim ammu: &lt;Meȓa ixes Siḏi Arebbi a neddar, a negg ccɣeȓ-a niɣ ḏ ccɣeȓ-in.&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Walakin ȓexxu kenniw teftaxarem, tsemɣarem ixef nwem. Marra ttakebbur-a am wanita netta ḏ ccarr. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Wenni itwaȓen can n ȓxir aṯ igg, meȓa war ṯ iggi ca itwaḥsab-as ḏ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ccarr n twajar iḍeǧmen iwḏan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Yallaheṯ a twajar, ṣennṭeṯ mliḥ! Truṯ, sɣuyeṯ x lmuṣibaṯ iy xawem d ɣa ihwan. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Agȓa nwem ixsar, arruḍ nwem ccin-ṯ ṯkeccawin. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Ddheb nwem ḏ nnuqarṯ nwem arcant, ṯarciṯ nni aḏ techeḏ ḍed nwem aḏ tecc aysum nwem am ṯmessi. Kenniw ṯxezznem agȓa s waṭṭas i yixef nwem ḏi ȓƹaheḏ-a aneggaru.<verse eid="JAS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Iwa, kenniw war txeǧisem ca icewwaren iy ḏawem imejjaren ḏeg imarjeƹiwen nwem, texȓiseṯ nsen ṯesɣuyiw-d tceṯca zzaywem. Ṯɣuyyeṯ nni n icewwaren itsȓa-yas Siḏi Arebbi Lƹalamin. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Kenniw tƹicem ḏi ddunect-a s ufelles ḏ ccehweṯ nwem. Ṯḏewȓem ṯṣaḥḥem ṯwejḏem am iyenduzen ḏi nhar nni iy ḏi ḏasen ɣa ɣarṣen. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Ṯḥekmem x yinni iǧan nican, ṯenɣim-ṯen bȓa ma ḏawem ƹarrḍen.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Labud ṣṣbar ḏeg uƹeddeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Ay ayṯma, ṣbareṯ aȓ d ɣa yas Siḏiṯneɣ. Xzareṯ ɣar ufeǧaḥ mammec itraja ṯafeǧaḥṯ n ṯmurṯ nnes, itraja-t s yijjen n ṣṣbar aȓ ɣa yuweṯ unẓar amezwaru ḏ wenni aneggaru. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Uȓa ḏ kenniw ṣbareṯ cejjƹeṯ ixef nwem minzi Siḏiṯneɣ ƹȓayen aḏ d iƹqeb.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Ay ayṯma, war ssawaȓeṯ ca ḏeg wayawya ḥima war twaƹiqibem ca; qa wenni iteḥkamen ibedd-d ɣar ṯewwarṯ. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Ay ayṯma, ḏfareṯ abriḏ n lʼanbiya yinni ig issiwȓen s yisem n Siḏi Arebbi niṯni twaƹeddben ṣebbaren. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Aqa ṯessnem yinni iṣbaren nteḥsab-iṯen ɣarsen ssaƹḏ. Kenniw ṯesȓim x ṣṣbar nni n nnabi Ayub, ṯessnem mammec ṯ ibarek Siḏi Arebbi ḏeg uneggaru minzi Siḏi Arebbi netta ḏ aḥnin ḏ araḥim.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Ay ayṯma, aqa min iǧan muhim. War tjaǧam ca s ujenna niɣ s ṯmurṯ niɣ s can ṯmesȓayṯ nneɣni. Iwa, xmi ɣa ṯinim wah, iniṯ wah. Xmi ɣa ṯinim lla, iniṯ lla. Ḥima war xawem d ihewwi ca lƹiqab.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jjheḏ n ṯẓaǧiṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Meȓa ḏin can yijjen jarawem itwaƹeddab, itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ iẓẓaǧ. Meȓa ḏin can yijjen jarawem ifarreḥ, itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ iɣennej i Arebbi. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Meȓa ḏin can yijjen jarawem itnezbar, itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ d iȓaɣa x imeqqranen n jmaƹṯ n ȓmuminin axas ẓẓaǧen aṯ dehnen s zzect s yisem n Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />U ṯẓaǧiṯ nni ṯenni itqeddamen s lʼiman aḏ tesgenfa wenni iǧan ƹeyyan. Ssenni Siḏiṯneɣ aṯ isbedd. Meȓa igga ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ, aḏas iɣfar. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Ƹtarfeṯ s ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nwem kenniw i wayawya, ẓẓaǧeṯ x wayawya ḥima aḏ tgenfam. Ṯẓaǧiṯ n bnaḏem ig iǧan nican nettaṯ ḏayes jjheḏ aṭṭas nettaṯ ṯefsus.<verse eid="JAS 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Tuɣa nnabi Ilyas netta ḏ bnaḏem am neccin, itẓaǧa aṭṭas ḥima war icciṯ bu unẓar. Ikka ṯeȓt snin ḏ uzyen war yuwṯi bu unẓar x ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Menbaƹd ƹaweḏ iẓẓuǧ, yuwṯa unẓar x ṯmurṯ ṯeṣȓaḥ ṯfeǧaḥṯ nnes.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19-20" />Ay ayṯma, can yijjen zzaywem iffeɣ abriḏ n lḥaqiqa. Meȓa yarri-ṯ-id can yijjen nneɣni, itxeṣṣa-kenniw aḏ tessnem belli wenni iy ṯiḏ yarrin zeg ubriḏ nnes n ȓbaṭeȓ ataf isenjem-iṯ zi ȓefna nnes ataf aḏ twaɣfarent aṭṭas n ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ.<verse eid="JAS 5:19-20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>